        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"context\":[{\"id\":\"c1\",\"text\":\"He served as Executive Vice President and Commercial Chief Marketing Officer from March 2020.\"},{\"id\":\"c2\",\"text\":\"Mr. Numoto served as a Corporate Vice President, Cloud Marketing from January 2012.\"},{\"id\":\"c3\",\"text\":\"Prior to that, Mr. Numoto served as a Corporate Vice President for Office 365 Marketing from 2004, where he led the transformation from traditional on-premises packaged software to the introduction of Office 365.\"},{\"id\":\"c4\",\"text\":\"Since joining Microsoft in 1997, Mr. Numoto has held multiple roles in Windows Program Management and Office Marketing.\"}],\"filing\":\"MSFT 10-K\",\"section\":\"Part I Item 1\",\"sentences\":[{\"id\":\"s1\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > INFORMATION ABOUT OUR EXECUTIVE OFFICERS\",\"text\":\"Mr. Smith was appointed Vice Chair and President in September 2021.\"},{\"id\":\"s2\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > INFORMATION ABOUT OUR EXECUTIVE OFFICERS\",\"text\":\"Prior to that, he served as President and Chief Legal Officer since September 2015.\"},{\"id\":\"s3\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > INFORMATION ABOUT OUR EXECUTIVE OFFICERS\",\"text\":\"He served as Executive Vice President, General Counsel, and Secretary from 2011 to 2015, and served as Senior Vice President, General Counsel, and Secretary from 2001 to 2011.\"},{\"id\":\"s4\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > INFORMATION ABOUT OUR EXECUTIVE OFFICERS\",\"text\":\"Mr. Smith was also named Chief Compliance Officer in 2002.\"},{\"id\":\"s5\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > INFORMATION ABOUT OUR EXECUTIVE OFFICERS\",\"text\":\"Since joining Microsoft in 1993, he was Deputy General Counsel for Worldwide Sales and previously was responsible for managing the European Law and Corporate Affairs Group, based in Paris.\"},{\"id\":\"s6\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > INFORMATION ABOUT OUR EXECUTIVE OFFICERS\",\"text\":\"Mr. Smith also serves on the Board of Directors of Netflix, Inc.\"},{\"id\":\"s7\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > AVAILABLE INFORMATION\",\"text\":\"Our Internet address is www.microsoft.com.\"},{\"id\":\"s8\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > AVAILABLE INFORMATION\",\"text\":\"At our Investor Relations website, www.microsoft.com/investor, we make available free of charge a variety of information for investors.\"},{\"id\":\"s9\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > AVAILABLE INFORMATION\",\"text\":\"Our goal is to maintain the Investor Relations website as a portal through which investors can easily find or navigate to pertinent information about us, including:\"},{\"id\":\"s10\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > AVAILABLE INFORMATION\",\"text\":\"Our annual report on Form 10-K, quarterly reports on Form 10-Q, current reports on Form 8-K, and any amendments to those reports, as soon as reasonably practicable after we electronically file that material with, or furnish it to, the Securities and Exchange Commission (“SEC”) at www.sec.gov.\"},{\"id\":\"s11\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > AVAILABLE INFORMATION\",\"text\":\"Information on our business strategies, financial results, and metrics for investors.\"},{\"id\":\"s12\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > AVAILABLE INFORMATION\",\"text\":\"Announcements of investor conferences, speeches, and events at which our executives talk about our product, service, and competitive strategies.\"},{\"id\":\"s13\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > AVAILABLE INFORMATION\",\"text\":\"Archives of these events are also available.\"},{\"id\":\"s14\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > AVAILABLE INFORMATION\",\"text\":\"Press releases on quarterly earnings, product and service announcements, and legal developments.\"},{\"id\":\"s15\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 1 > AVAILABLE INFORMATION\",\"text\":\"Corporate governance information including our articles of incorporation, bylaws, governance guidelines, committee charters, codes of conduct and ethics, corporate responsibility initiatives, and other governance-related policies.\"}]}"
      }
